        "subject": "LU-20491 obdclass: remove uuid2dev() interface",
        "message": "LU-20491 obdclass: remove uuid2dev() interface\n\nNo Lustre tool calls the uuid2dev ioctl(). No userspace\nprogram ought to call this ioctl(), since they could just\nas easily parse the global device list. Remove this interface.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Ia12e12fc2627a78f455863bff8f7a7f397856a82\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/67352\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nReviewed-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\n"
